   "source": [
    "# NiCo\u2082S\u2084 sulfur thermodynamics\n",
    "\n",
    "Interactive Colab notebook for the `(100)` and `(311)` datasets.\n",
    "\n",
    "The notebook uses rhombic sulfur as the sulfur reference and the alignment\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\mathrm{S_{rhombic}+H^++2e^-\\rightleftharpoons HS^-}$$\n",
    "\n",
    "with\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\Delta\\mu_S = 2(U_{\\rm RHE}-E_{\\rm eq,RHE}).$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Choose the surface and electrochemical conditions below. The first plot is the sulfur chemical-potential / potential phase diagram; the second is an energy-level diagram evaluated at the chosen voltage bias."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
[![Open In Colab](https://colab.research.google.com/assets/colab-badge.svg)](https://colab.research.google.com/github/jollactic/LiCo2S4/blob/main/PLOTTING/NiCo2S4_sulfur_thermodynamics_colab.ipynb)
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
